<%# locals: (listing:, form: nil) %>
<%# The location filter (spec 037 decision 6; spec 065 decision 4): the design system's FilterSelect, all, none, then the account's
    Places and Decks (each deck's "all zones" first, then its zones), grouped as every picker is.
    c-select--wide lifts its cap from 220px to 300px in a collection 640px wide or wider (spec 057 decision 4); the Set
    select on search and the Language select on number entry are c-select too and stay at 220px (decision 18). %>
<label class="c-select c-select--wide"><span class="c-sr">Location</span><%= select_tag :location,
      location_options(listing.choices, selected: listing.location, leading: [ [ "All locations", "" ], [ "No location", CollectionFilter::Place::NONE ] ], deck_values: true),
      form:, id: nil %></label>
